@HostAddress = https://localhost:7021

### 1. Criar Usuário (POST)
POST {{HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "brian"
}

### 2. Tentar Criar Usuário Duplicado (POST - Deve retornar 409 Conflict)
POST {{HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "brian"
}

### 3. Criar Segundo Usuário (POST)
POST {{HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "alice"
}

### 4. Listar Todos os Usuários (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/users
Accept: application/json

### 5. Buscar Usuário Específico por Username (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/users/brian
Accept: application/json

### 6. Atualizar Username (PUT)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/users/brian
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newUsername": "brian_silva"
}

### 7. Consultar Novo Username Atualizado (GET)
GET {{HostAddress}}/users/brian_silva
Accept: application/json

### 8. Deletar Usuário (DELETE)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/users/alice

### 9. Confirmar Exclusão (GET - Deve retornar 404 Not Found)
GET {{HostAddress}}/users/alice
Accept: application/json
